Sample data (data/sample-photographs.ttl, pipeline/*.csv,
pipeline/generated-from-csv.ttl, reports/iiif-collection-manifest.json):
  Released into the public domain under CC0 1.0 —
  https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
  These records are illustrative — modeled on publicly known characteristics
  of heritage collections — and make no claim of original archival data.

Harvested-data derivatives (data/real-ncap-sample.ttl, data/real-napl-sample.ttl,
data/real-whai-sample.ttl, reports/real-*.geojson, reports/real-iiif-collection.json,
reports/stac/):
  NOT covered by the CC0 dedication above, and not licensed by this repository.
  - real-ncap-sample.ttl is an insubstantial extract (300 of roughly 1.14
    million records, 0.026 per cent) derived from the NCAP Air Photo Finder
    catalogue by a lawful user under regulation 19 of the Copyright and Rights
    in Databases Regulations 1997. Rights in the catalogue remain with NCAP /
    Historic Environment Scotland. The rights statement it carries is an
    adapter-supplied interim statement, not asserted by NCAP.
  - real-napl-sample.ttl contains information licensed under the Open
    Government Licence - Canada
    (https://open.canada.ca/en/open-government-licence-canada).
  - real-whai-sample.ttl is derived from public-domain aerial survey records
    published by the Wisconsin State Cartographer's Office without fee or use
    restriction.

